{
  "id": "hina_spring_bento",
  "title": "春の公園でのお弁当タイム",
  "return": {
    "mode": "town",
    "season": "spring"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "bg": "images/assets/bgev/bg_park_spring.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【思い出ストーリー】春の公園でのお弁当タイム"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "春の昼下がり。外回りの途中で少し時間が空いた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "若葉中央公園も近いし、休憩がてら寄っていくか。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "公園には、春の陽射しがやわらかく差し込んでいた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "桜の花びらが、風に乗ってゆっくりと舞っている。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ベンチの並ぶ広場へ向かうと、見慣れた赤い髪が目に入った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あっ、店長！　お疲れさまです！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "緋奈？　こんなところで会うとは思わなかったな。昼休みか？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "はいっ。今日は天気がよかったので、外でお弁当にしようかなって。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "なるほど。公園で弁当か、いいな。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈の膝の上には、クロスを敷いたお弁当箱が広げられていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それ、手作りか？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "もちろんです！　あたし、こう見えて料理はけっこうできるんですよ？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "へえ……うまそうだな。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "えへへ。じゃあ……一口、食べます？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10701.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "いいのか？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10701.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "はい。小さいハンバーグですけど、味には自信あります！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "bg": "images/assets/bgev/bg_memory_hina_spring_bento.png",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈は赤い箸で、お弁当のハンバーグをひと口分だけ切り分けると、少し照れた顔でこちらへ差し出してきた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "ほら、店長。あーん……です。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……いただきます。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "甘辛いソースの香りがふわりと広がる。ひと口噛むと、肉の旨みとやさしい味付けがちょうどよく混ざった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……うまい。これ、本当に緋奈が作ったのか？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "本当ですよ！？　もう、そこ疑うところじゃないですって！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "いや、素直に驚いた。これはかなりうまい。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "えへへ……そこまで言われると、ちょっと照れますね。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "bg": "images/assets/bgev/bg_park_spring.png",
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "この腕前なら、いいお嫁さんになれるよ。",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10701.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "へっ……？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a11201.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈の顔が、みるみる赤く染まっていった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、あたし。もう戻りますね！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "え？　もう行くのか？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "はいっ！　お、お店でまた！",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈はお弁当を慌てて片づけると、小走りで公園を出ていった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "……急にどうしたんだろう？",
      "characters": [
        {
          "side": "center",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10501.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ベンチに残った春の陽射しと、口の中に広がるハンバーグの味だけが、しばらく店長の記憶に残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "【思い出アルバムに追加】緋奈「春の公園でのお弁当タイム」"
    }
  ]
}